1
00:00:00,079 --> 00:00:02,120
I built a real casino inside Minecraft,

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,370
and the House always wins.

3
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:05,099
Every item you own is worth chips,

4
00:00:05,099 --> 00:00:06,910
and the dealer will happily buy your loot.

5
00:00:07,075 --> 00:00:07,815
But every ten minutes,

6
00:00:07,815 --> 00:00:09,235
the House collects its fee,

7
00:00:09,235 --> 00:00:10,915
and if you can't pay, your run is over.

8
00:00:10,915 --> 00:00:13,244
So you can grind, or you can gamble.

9
00:00:13,244 --> 00:00:14,984
Spin the slots for free spins,

10
00:00:14,984 --> 00:00:15,704
drop the Plinko ball,

11
00:00:15,704 --> 00:00:16,524
and cash out

12
00:00:16,524 --> 00:00:18,364
of Crash before the rocket blows up.

13
00:00:18,364 --> 00:00:19,124
Lose a bet,

14
00:00:19,124 --> 00:00:21,074
and the House sends monsters after you.

15
00:00:21,224 --> 00:00:22,124
And if you die?

16
00:00:22,124 --> 00:00:23,754
You play Blackjack for your life.

17
00:00:24,021 --> 00:00:24,941
It's one of fifty challenges

18
00:00:24,941 --> 00:00:27,441
in Challenge Craft, free on CurseForge.

19
00:00:27,441 --> 00:00:28,291
Would you gamble?

